# Apple Design for UI

Before building or changing UI (layout, motion, materials, typography, gestures, chrome), read and follow:

- `.cursor/skills/apple-design/SKILL.md`

Also mirrored at `.claude/skills/apple-design/SKILL.md`.

Apply the skill's rules for response latency, interruptible springs, translucent materials, size-specific tracking, and `prefers-reduced-motion`. Do not introduce a separate design system that conflicts with it.
